<lg label="2."><l>When I go out to preach</l><l>I don’t know what to say,</l><l>And I still cry</l><l>When I don’t get my way.</l><l>Just can’t see</l><l>Why the Lord would want</l><l>Someone like me.</l><l>Wretched man that I am!</l><l>Who will deliver me?</l><l>Wretched man that I am!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>So I just live</l><l>By the Spirit in me,</l><l>Because this gives</l><l>Life inwardly.</l><l>Filled with peace</l><l>Even when I may fail miserably,</l><l>No condemnation to those</l><l>Who are in Jesus Christ.</l><l>No condemnation to those.</l></lg>
</div>
</back></music></mei>
